            "detailed_description": "<strong>Papetura</strong> é uma aventura de quebra-cabeças feita à mão, totalmente em papel. <br>A música temática composta por Floex, dá um toque de mistério a este <strong>peculiar mundo de papel, envolto em sombras e luz.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/593640/extras/c4fd01820527224afe2950a7801ff6b2.poster.avif?t=1787737355\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/593640/extras/c4fd01820527224afe2950a7801ff6b2.webm?t=1787737355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/593640/extras/c4fd01820527224afe2950a7801ff6b2.mp4?t=1787737355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/593640/extras/84f1e5485a7f4e5f7defb0bc29fd4b57.avif?t=1787737355\" width=600 height=111 /></span><br><br><strong>Características:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Aventura gráfica única, com a duração de 2 horas.<br></li><li>É tudo feito de papel: desde pequenos insetos e estranhas criaturas e monstros aos locais repletos de magia.<br></li><li>Fantástica música temática composta por <strong>Floex (Tomas Dvorak)</strong>.<br></li><li>O mundo e a história estão repletos de quebra-cabeças. <br></li><li>A história é contada com animações e barulhos estranhos, sem a presença de diálogos.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/593640/extras/064fcdff729c18c556818c8570bc89ec.poster.avif?t=1787737355\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/593640/extras/064fcdff729c18c556818c8570bc89ec.webm?t=1787737355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/593640/extras/064fcdff729c18c556818c8570bc89ec.mp4?t=1787737355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>História</strong><br>Papetura conta a história de <strong>Pape</strong>, uma criatura de papel solitária presa numa prisão rebuscada. Certo dia, Pape escapa e encontra <strong>Tura</strong>, um pequeno ser encantado do qual terá de cuidar. Juntos irão enfrentar <strong>monstros sombrios e flamejantes</strong> que querem incendiar o mundo papel de que tanto gostam.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/593640/extras/e50e534a18f8a46fe7e53b8f92f473e0.poster.avif?t=1787737355\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/593640/extras/e50e534a18f8a46fe7e53b8f92f473e0.webm?t=1787737355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/593640/extras/e50e534a18f8a46fe7e53b8f92f473e0.mp4?t=1787737355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Equipa</strong><br>A equipa é composta pelo criador <i>Tomasz Ostafin (Petums)</i>, pelo músico <i>Tomas Dvorak (Floex)</i> e pelo sound designer <i>Juraj Mravec</i>. O jogo levou anos a ser desenvolvido e é inspirado em clássicos como <i>The Neverhood</i> e <i>Machinarium</i>, em filmes do estúdio <i>Ghibli</i> e ganhou forma graças a um fascínio pela arquitetura e esculturas de papel.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/593640/extras/5fc623930e1398c49d0520fa0d988009.avif?t=1787737355\" width=600 height=164 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/593640/extras/7e4320da4305c5950e7f93f525e38314.poster.avif?t=1787737355\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/593640/extras/7e4320da4305c5950e7f93f525e38314.webm?t=1787737355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/593640/extras/7e4320da4305c5950e7f93f525e38314.mp4?t=1787737355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
